{
  "voice": "male",
  "total": 59.3,
  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "What if tomorrow morning you wake up?",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.6954545454545453
    },
    {
      "text": "You grab your phone, and there is no internet?",
      "start": 2.6954545454545453,
      "end": 5.390909090909091
    },
    {
      "text": "No internet at all, no Wi-Fi, no mobile data.",
      "start": 5.390909090909091,
      "end": 8.086363636363636
    },
    {
      "text": "Imagine you cannot check the news, send a message,",
      "start": 8.086363636363636,
      "end": 10.781818181818181
    },
    {
      "text": "watch a video.",
      "start": 10.781818181818181,
      "end": 13.477272727272727
    },
    {
      "text": "The first day without internet is panic.",
      "start": 13.477272727272727,
      "end": 16.172727272727272
    },
    {
      "text": "People go outside because they cannot stay home",
      "start": 16.172727272727272,
      "end": 18.868181818181817
    },
    {
      "text": "without content.",
      "start": 18.868181818181817,
      "end": 21.563636363636363
    },
    {
      "text": "Children play outside because tablets do not work.",
      "start": 21.563636363636363,
      "end": 24.259090909090908
    },
    {
      "text": "The second day is silence, nobody knows what is",
      "start": 24.259090909090908,
      "end": 26.954545454545453
    },
    {
      "text": "happening in the world.",
      "start": 26.954545454545453,
      "end": 29.65
    },
    {
      "text": "ATMs do not work, cards are not accepted, money cannot",
      "start": 29.65,
      "end": 32.345454545454544
    },
    {
      "text": "be transferred.",
      "start": 32.345454545454544,
      "end": 35.04090909090909
    },
    {
      "text": "The third day people start talking in person.",
      "start": 35.04090909090909,
      "end": 37.736363636363635
    },
    {
      "text": "They meet in cafes, parks, streets.",
      "start": 37.736363636363635,
      "end": 40.43181818181818
    },
    {
      "text": "The fourth day new habits appear.",
      "start": 40.43181818181818,
      "end": 43.127272727272725
    },
    {
      "text": "People read books, walk, exercise.",
      "start": 43.127272727272725,
      "end": 45.82272727272727
    },
    {
      "text": "The fifth day does not change.",
      "start": 45.82272727272727,
      "end": 48.518181818181816
    },
    {
      "text": "Maybe we are too dependent on the internet.",
      "start": 48.518181818181816,
      "end": 51.21363636363636
    },
    {
      "text": "Or the internet is just a tool, not the meaning of life.",
      "start": 51.21363636363636,
      "end": 53.90909090909091
    },
    {
      "text": "What do you think?",
      "start": 53.90909090909091,
      "end": 56.60454545454545
    },
    {
      "text": "Write in the comments.",
      "start": 56.60454545454545,
      "end": 59.3
    }
  ]
}